<title>TAIWAN: President Jan-Oct profit up 29 pct.</title>
<headline>President Jan-Oct profit up 29 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's largest food processor President Enterprises Corp said on Monday its pre-tax profit in the January-October period rose 29 percent to T$2.455 billion from T$1.904 billion in the same period last year.</p>
<p>Sales revenue during the January-October period this year totalled T$22.957 billion compared with T$21.631 billion in the same period last year, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
